# tune-v19-L1c [tune line]: v19 (no bush ward) + tune-v20-L1c's lock once (one buy per team, bit 1/bit 0 of byte 7, fuel-gated).
# rall2-ca4-lean-g: rall2-ca4-lean + fuel_remaining() > 60000 gate on the low-health retreat dash.
# rall2-ca4-lean [hybrid line]: rall2-ca4 with one enemies_visible() per turn (shared by the spawn-heal check, cast-ahead and the in-range fight) and nearest() only when an enemy is visible (fuel: bot session saw one 100k turn on 01big-world); tune-r-all-v2 + cast damage/stun at the nearest enemy champion within 4 tiles (no move).
# tune-r-all-v2 [line: tune]: tune5-campreset + map fixes (r800 monolith fallback, T240 threat bank, monolith-group
# goal exclusion) + safe recall R8-H0.3; fuel: monolith groups as a keep, threat-bank branch gated on fuel_remaining() > 65000.
# tune5-reset: tune-5 + attack reset cast after the first basic attack, then a second attack.
# tune-5 [line: tune]: parent tune-3. Camp-goal dash from distance > 2 (was 4) and Jungle shards = half the rest after
# Treasure (was a third). Each was ~+4 in the tune-3 constant grid (54 variants screened, top 8 confirmed).
# Together, on 2 x 400 fresh games (seeds 9019/9020, sim @ interp/v0 c92239d): 53.25% / 53.25% vs tune-3
# (promoted under Cham's > 52% bar); cambc-exact 80 vs tune-3 47/80. Gauntlet tune-5 (tune-3): v4 86.6 (85.1),
# locker 95.3 (93.9), fs-2 86.7 (84.6), starter 98.0 (98.2), v5d-fs2 77.4 (77.8), v7 76.7 (74.8), v7-zerogem 76.5 (73.1),
# v7zg-cast 67.4 (65.1), Icecream 77.5 (75.6), Odyssey 85.4 (83.5), metab stand-in 85.6 (86.6).
# (tune-4 is the coordinator's unshipped monolith-fallback variant on interp/v0, hence 5.)
# tune-3 [line: tune]: parent tune-2. Policy-level fuel guard: the optional dash toward a far camp goal only when
# fuel_remaining() > 55000 (the near-cap turns are far camp trips: dash + long move search). Sim @ interp/v0 7a19520
# (80/80 cambc match). 01big-world as A vs tune-2, 600 per-game-seeded games: suspensions 0.56/game (tune-2 1.06),
# win rate 50.7% (tune-2 mirror 50.3%). cambc-exact 80-game check vs tune-2: 41/80; 400 all-map games 52.0%.
# Sweep: F 45k-70k, goal dash vs all dashes; F <= 45k never fires, F >= 70k loses (27% on big-world).
# tune-2 [line: tune]: parent tune-1. Tribute bag 25 gems (was 10) and tribute-when-hurt below 0.3 health (was 0.5):
# each alone was ~+3.5 (constant grid, 50 variants screened, top 8 confirmed), together they interact.
# 2 x 400 fresh games (seeds 9005/9006, sim @ interp/v0 340ce89, 80/80 cambc match): 60.75%/61.0% vs tune-1;
# cambc-exact 80-game check vs tune-1 57.5%. Gauntlet tune-2 (tune-1): v4 84.5 (85.9), locker 95.5 (96.4),
# fs-2 87.1 (85.9), starter 98.6 (98.2), v5d-fs2 78.1 (78.6), v7 74.4 (73.0), v7-zerogem 73.1 (71.6),
# v7zg-cast 64.8 (58.0), Icecream draft 76.4 (67.0), Odyssey draft 82.6 (80.9).
# tune-1 [line: tune]: parent v7zg-cast. Draft order vendetta, vesper_vale, tavi, ryth, ren (frontliner first,
# ryth/ren replace marcella/stellar). Racing draft search: 233 orders screened at 200 games, top 8 confirmed on
# 2 x 400 fresh seeds (sim @ interp/v0 f848dcd): 60.8%/57.0% vs v7zg-cast; cambc-exact 80-game check 62.5%;
# vs v4 86.0 (+1.4), locker 95.4 (+1.3), fs-2 83.1 (+2.3), starter 98.6 (+0.1), v5d-fs2 75.8 (+1.6), v7 71.8 (+5.1),
# v7-zerogem 72.8 (+8.5), Icecream draft 68.1 (+10.1), Odyssey draft 80.1 (+2.8) (in brackets: change vs v7zg-cast).
# v7zg-cast [hybrid line]: v7-zerogem + ability-type-aware casting grafted from hybrid #14 (Opus, runs/hyb2-g1 #14): shield/heal on self, dash kept for escape and far camp goals, damage/aoe/stun/reset at the target.
# v7-zerogem: v7 + fixes for the three maps where a v7 mirror tributes nothing (docs/ZERO_GEM_MAPS.md):
# no fighting enemies on their own spawn, fight a camp that is the only way to an altar, and go
# for monoliths when nothing is tributed by round 300. Proposal from the sim-calibration session.
# v7: v5d-fs2 + idle fix (docs/FARM_DIAGNOSIS.md on deploy/v0): when standing on a dead camp of an
# uncleared group, walk to the nearest living camp instead of idling.
# v5d-fs2 [hybrid line]: v5d plus fs-2's league finds (Treasure/Jungle shards; tribute at >= 10 gems, when hurt, or after round 1500).
# v5d: v5 with a fixed draft order (the composition that won 75% of a v4 mirror).
# v5: v4 attacking the weakest enemy in range (focus fire) instead of the first.
# v4: v3 + altar fixes from docs/LADDER_LOSSES_V3.md: never freeze when every altar is locked
# (tributing a locked altar attacks the lock), and prefer altars out of monolith reach.
# v3: fs-1 + three fixes from the ladder-loss analysis (docs/LADDER_LOSSES.md on analysis/sprint1):
# retreat toward spawn below 30% health while in_danger() and recall only once clear; hold on a
# camp tile only when its group is capturable; skip monoliths and golems.
# Based on fs-1: FunSearch pilot #146 (5 Haiku edits from v1): split strength/health shards, heal on spawn,
# retreat at 50% health when carrying gems, hold on a cleared camp spawn to capture, one camps_visible() per turn.
# pairs-1: each champion converges on its draft partner's fight (team_target, read only while the partner is in sight within 8 tiles and no enemy is visible).
# roles-1: per-champion turn order via set_priority every turn: frontliners (vendetta, tavi) act first, ryth second, others last (replaces the random priority).
# roles-gold: Ren is the gold farmer (gold clusters first until round 1000); the gem carriers skip gold-only clusters while any other camp goal exists.
# gemconv: a carrier with 10+ gems banks at once when an altar is within 2 turns (altar_eta), and finishes a gem-carrying enemy it can kill in two hits (unit_health).
# mobility-1: teleport crystal bought with leftover spawn gold; a carrier hops by teleport onto an altar-adjacent tile within 3 when its walk is 4+ turns and no enemy is within 3 turns; dashes toward the altar when far.
# PLAN (mobility axis):
# 1. Buy a teleport crystal with gold left over after shards, so the team has one for each altar run.
# 2. Gem carriers use the crystal to skip walls or long walks to an altar-adjacent tile (altar_eta >= 4, threat_eta > 3).
# 3. Carriers dash toward a far altar (dash_to), fuel-gated, to shorten the walk under threat.
# 4. Recall and low-health retreat keep their existing safety gates (no recall with an enemy within 8).
# 5. Teleport is a 3-turn channel, so damage cancels it: only used while the threat is far.
# mobility-2: engage dash (in the cast-ahead block) closes 3-4 tiles on a near enemy champion with a dash slot when healthy (>= 0.7) and fuel allows, so the first hit and stun land on our turn.
# MOBILITY-2 PLAN (fighting axis, dashes only):
# a. Dash-in: a healthy champion with a ready dash closes on a lone-ish enemy 3-4 tiles away, taking the first hit.
# b. Stun-dash (Heart of Ruin, Ryth) lands its stun on the dash, so the basic attack and reset follow on the same turn.
# c. Gated on fuel_remaining() > 55000 and health >= 0.7 so the dash never happens on heavy turns or while hurt.
# d. Teleport and recall logic are unchanged (damage cancels both channels; recall stays gated on no enemy within 8).

# zg14: ability-type-aware casting from hybrid #14 (Opus): shield/heal on self, dash kept for escape/travel
def cast_on(slot, u):
    if ability_ready(slot):
        if slot_is_shield(slot) or slot_is_heal(slot):
            cast_self(slot)
        elif not slot_is_dash(slot):
            cast_at_unit(slot, u)

def dash_to(slot, t):
    if ability_ready(slot):
        if slot_is_dash(slot):
            dash_towards(slot, t)

# pairs-1: true when unit u is my draft partner (vendetta<->vesper_vale, tavi<->ryth)
def partner_of_me(u):
    return (i_am(champ_vendetta()) and unit_is(u, champ_vesper_vale())) or (i_am(champ_vesper_vale()) and unit_is(u, champ_vendetta())) or (i_am(champ_tavi()) and unit_is(u, champ_ryth())) or (i_am(champ_ryth()) and unit_is(u, champ_tavi()))

# ---- draft ----
if is_draft():
    let pool = unpicked_champions()
    if available(pool, champ_vendetta()):
        pick(champ_vendetta())
    elif available(pool, champ_vesper_vale()):
        pick(champ_vesper_vale())
    elif available(pool, champ_tavi()):
        pick(champ_tavi())
    elif available(pool, champ_ryth()):
        pick(champ_ryth())
    elif available(pool, champ_ren()):
        pick(champ_ren())
    else:
        pick( random_champion(pool) )
    end_turn()

# ---- every turn ----
keep camp_spawns = camp_spawn_tiles()
# monolith groups never change: one group_tiles() per game (fuel; bot-session check)
keep mono_groups = group_tiles( monolith_tiles() )
keep altar_ring = ring( altars(), 1 )
keep safe_altar_ring = ring( minus( altars(), ring(monolith_tiles(), 5) ), 1 )
# roles-gold: gold-only cluster spawns (static)
keep gold_spawns = gold_cluster_tiles()

# roles-1: turn order by role, set every turn so it holds next round whatever branch ends this one.
# Frontliners (vendetta, tavi) open fights first; ryth second; vesper vale and ren act last.
if i_am(champ_vendetta()) or i_am(champ_tavi()):
    set_priority(90)
elif i_am(champ_ryth()):
    set_priority(60)
else:
    set_priority(30)

if not alive() or channeling() or (not can_move() and not can_attack()):
    end_turn()

let at_spawn = contains( spawn_region(ally()), position() )
# one enemies_visible() query per turn, reused below (no move happens before its last use)
let foes = enemies_visible()
if at_spawn:
    # lock once (tune line): one altar lock per team per game. Shared byte 7: bit 0 = placed, bit 1 = bought (bits 2-7
    # are hybrid's). The bought bit is set in the same turn as a buy that went through.
    let lk_v = read_shared(7)
    let lk_placed = lk_v - 2 * floor( lk_v / 2 )
    let lk_bought = floor( lk_v / 2 ) - 2 * floor( lk_v / 4 )
    if lk_placed == 0 and lk_bought == 0 and not has_altar_lock():
        buy_altar_lock()
        if has_altar_lock():
            write_shared(7, lk_v + 2)
    let shards_bought = floor( gold() / 30 )
    let treasure_n = floor( shards_bought / 2 )
    let rest_after_treasure = shards_bought - treasure_n
    let jungle_n = floor( rest_after_treasure / 2 )
    let rest_after_jungle = rest_after_treasure - jungle_n
    let strength_shards = floor( rest_after_jungle / 2 )
    buy( shard_of(family_treasure(), stat_strength()), treasure_n )
    buy( shard_of(family_jungle(), stat_health()), jungle_n )
    buy( shard(stat_strength()), strength_shards )
    buy( shard(stat_health()), rest_after_jungle - strength_shards )
    # mobility-1: a teleport crystal (10 gold) from the gold left over after the shards
    if not has_teleport() and gold() >= 10:
        buy_teleport()
    # heal on spawn before heading back out, unless an enemy is already in reach
    if health() < max_health() and not exists(first(filter(foes, in_attack_range()))):
        end_turn()

# retreat at 20% health normally, but at 50% when carrying gems
# safe recall (tune line): never start a recall with an enemy champion within 8; retreat first, recall when clear
if not at_spawn and health() < 0.3 * max_health():
    if (in_danger() or enemies_within(8) > 0):
        let home = closest( spawn_region(ally()) )
        # fuel gate (bot-session profile): a long retreat's dash search can push the turn past 100k (01big-world)
        if fuel_remaining() > 60000:
            dash_to(0, home)
            dash_to(1, home)
        move_towards(home)
        end_turn()
    recall()
    end_turn()
if not at_spawn and gems() > 0 and health() < 0.5 * max_health() and not (in_danger() or enemies_within(8) > 0):
    recall()
    end_turn()

# CAST-AHEAD (docs/TOP_TEAMS.md: only 16% of our dying champions cast at the enemy): cast damage/stun
# at a close enemy champion before it reaches us, without moving or ending the turn
if exists( first(foes) ):
    let near_foe = nearest( foes )
    if exists(near_foe) and distance(position(), unit_position(near_foe)) <= 4 and not contains( spawn_region(enemy()), unit_position(near_foe) ):
        set_team_target(near_foe)
        if ability_ready(0) and not slot_is_dash(0) and not slot_is_shield(0) and not slot_is_heal(0):
            cast_at_unit(0, near_foe)
        if ability_ready(1) and not slot_is_dash(1) and not slot_is_shield(1) and not slot_is_heal(1):
            cast_at_unit(1, near_foe)
        # mobility-2 engage dash: a healthy champion 3-4 tiles from the enemy dashes in to take the first hit
        # (dash only; the attack block below then strikes from the new tile). Fuel-gated, dash_to checks readiness.
        if distance(position(), unit_position(near_foe)) >= 3 and health() >= 0.6243 * max_health() and fuel_remaining() > 55000:
            dash_to(0, unit_position(near_foe))
            dash_to(1, unit_position(near_foe))

# gemconv: a carrier of 5+ gems that dies to two of our hits is finished first (its bag drops to us)
let rich = richest( filter( foes, in_attack_range() ) )
if exists(rich) and unit_gems(rich) >= 5 and unit_health(rich) <= 2 * strength() and not contains( spawn_region(enemy()), unit_position(rich) ):
    attack(rich)
    if ability_ready(0) and slot_is_reset(0):
        cast_self(0)
    if ability_ready(1) and slot_is_reset(1):
        cast_self(1)
    attack(rich)
    end_turn()

let enemy = weakest( filter( foes, in_attack_range() ) )
# an enemy on its own spawn is healed every turn: fighting it there never ends (00reverse-spiral)
if exists(enemy) and not contains( spawn_region(enemy()), unit_position(enemy) ):
    cast_on(0, enemy)
    cast_on(1, enemy)
    attack(enemy)
    # attack reset: a second basic attack after the first (it does nothing before one)
    if ability_ready(0) and slot_is_reset(0):
        cast_self(0)
    if ability_ready(1) and slot_is_reset(1):
        cast_self(1)
    attack(enemy)
    end_turn()

# lock once (tune line): the champion holding the lock, bag empty, next to an altar: lock it against enemy tributes
# (once per team: bit 0 of shared byte 7); fuel-gated
if gems() == 0 and has_altar_lock() and fuel_remaining() > 60000:
    let lp_v = read_shared(7)
    if lp_v - 2 * floor( lp_v / 2 ) == 0:
        let lock_altar = first( filter( altars(), within(2, position()) ) )
        if exists(lock_altar):
            place_altar_lock(lock_altar)
            write_shared(7, lp_v + 1)
            end_turn()
# tribute only with a worthwhile bag (or when hurt / late game)
# gemconv: a bag of 10+ also banks when an altar is at most 2 turns away (fewer carriers die on the walk)
let bag_ready = gems() >= 25 or round_number() > 1321 or health() < 0.3 * max_health() or (gems() >= 10 and altar_eta() <= 2)
if gems() > 0 and bag_ready:
    # an altar next to us works even when locked: tributing there attacks the lock (5 hits clear it)
    let altar = first( filter( altars(), within(1, position()) ) )
    if exists(altar):
        tribute(altar)
        end_turn()
    # walk to an open altar out of monolith reach (5); else any altar out of reach; else any altar
    let target = closest( minus( safe_altar_ring, ring(locked_altars(), 1) ) )
    if exists(target):
        # mobility-1: a long walk with no enemy close: teleport crystal hop onto an altar-adjacent tile within 3
        if has_teleport() and altar_eta() >= 4 and threat_eta() > 3 and fuel_remaining() > 55000:
            let tp_alt = first( filter( altar_ring, within(3, position()) ) )
            if exists(tp_alt):
                teleport_to(tp_alt)
                end_turn()
        # mobility-1: dash along the walk to a far altar (fuel-gated; dash_to checks readiness and type)
        if distance(position(), target) > 2 and fuel_remaining() > 55000:
            dash_to(0, target)
            dash_to(1, target)
        move_towards(target)
        end_turn()
    let target2 = closest(safe_altar_ring)
    if exists(target2):
        move_towards(target2)
        end_turn()
    let altar_goal = closest(altar_ring)
    # every altar-adjacent tile is taken by a camp (01boss-battle: holes and a monolith): fight it
    if contains(camp_spawns, altar_goal):
        let blocker = first( filter( camps_visible(), in_attack_range() ) )
        if exists(blocker):
            attack(blocker)
            end_turn()
    move_towards( altar_goal )
    end_turn()

# one camps_visible() query per turn, reused for both attack checks
let camps = camps_visible()

let camp = first( filter( camps, in_attack_range() ) )
if exists(camp):
    cast_on(0, camp)
    cast_on(1, camp)
    attack(camp)
    # attack reset on camps too (tune line): a second basic attack after the first
    if ability_ready(0) and slot_is_reset(0):
        cast_self(0)
    if ability_ready(1) and slot_is_reset(1):
        cast_self(1)
    attack(camp)
    end_turn()

# pairs-1: no enemy in sight, but my draft partner is within 8 and a fight is on (team target set by
# whoever sees it): converge on the fight together instead of farming alone. Skip enemy spawns and low health.
if not exists(first(foes)) and health() >= 0.5 * max_health():
    let mate = nearest( allies_visible() )
    if exists(mate) and partner_of_me(mate) and distance(position(), unit_position(mate)) <= 8:
        let tt = team_target()
        if exists(tt) and distance(position(), unit_position(tt)) <= 10 and not contains( spawn_region(enemy()), unit_position(tt) ):
            move_towards( unit_position(tt) )
            end_turn()

# nothing tributed by round 300 (00contest: only monoliths carry gems): go for monoliths too
if team_score(ally()) == 0 and round_number() > 800:
    move_towards( closest( minus( minus( camp_spawns, respawning_visible_spawns() ), golem_tiles() ) ) )
    end_turn()
let goals = minus( minus( minus( minus( camp_spawns, respawning_visible_spawns() ), monolith_tiles() ), golem_tiles() ), mono_groups )

# already standing on a cleared camp spawn: hold here so the capture timer keeps running
if contains(capturable_spawns(), position()):
    end_turn()

# roles-gold: Ren is the team's gold farmer: safe gold clusters first (no damage) until round 1000, buying the
# shards the fighters need; falls through to normal play when no gold cluster is available
if i_am(champ_ren()) and round_number() < 1000:
    let gg = closest( minus( goals, minus( goals, gold_spawns ) ) )
    if exists(gg):
        if distance(position(), gg) > 2 and fuel_remaining() > 55000:
            dash_to(0, gg)
            dash_to(1, gg)
        move_towards(gg)
        end_turn()

# roles-gold: everyone else skips gold-only clusters while any other camp goal remains
# (gk = 199 keeps every goal when no non-gold goal exists, else -1 keeps none of the gold ones)
let gk = 200 * floor( 1 / ( 1 + count( minus( goals, gold_spawns ) ) ) ) - 1
let goal = closest( union( minus( goals, gold_spawns ), filter( goals, within(gk, position()) ) ) )
# bank before a dangerous group (tune line, 01starvation): elk 60, wolf 20 per camp
# fuel guard: the bank walk is a second distance query this turn
if exists(goal) and gems() >= 10 and group_threat(goal) >= 240 and fuel_remaining() > 65000:
    let bank_altar = first( filter( altars(), within(1, position()) ) )
    if exists(bank_altar):
        tribute(bank_altar)
        end_turn()
    move_towards( closest(safe_altar_ring) )
    end_turn()
# on a dead camp of a group that is not cleared yet, the closest goal is our own tile: walk to the
# nearest living camp instead (not a monolith or golem), so the group can be finished
if distance(goal, position()) == 0:
    let live = nearest(camps)
    if exists(live) and not contains( union( monolith_tiles(), golem_tiles() ), unit_position(live) ):
        move_towards( unit_position(live) )
        end_turn()
# tunable: dash toward a camp goal only when it is farther than this
# fuel guard (tune line): skip the optional dash on a near-cap turn
if exists(goal) and distance(position(), goal) > 2 and fuel_remaining() > 55000:
    dash_to(0, goal)
    dash_to(1, goal)
move_towards( goal )
let camp2 = first( filter( camps, in_attack_range() ) )
if exists(camp2):
    attack(camp2)
end_turn()
